# Zoraline, Cosmos Caller: "you may pay {W}{B} and 2 life". At 1 life Bot1 can't pay 2 life (CR 119.4, 118.3), so the whole
# payment can't be made and is not offered, though the mana for it is in the pool: the enters trigger resolves without a
# question, the {B} stays unspent and the Ornithopter stays in the graveyard. The positive control is the same payment at
# exactly 2 life (zoraline-at-exactly-2-life-...), which is asked.

[Life]
Bot1: 1

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Entomb
Zoraline, Cosmos Caller
Swamp
Ornithopter
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Zoraline, Cosmos Caller.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Decline
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Mana = {B}

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus; Entomb; Ornithopter
